{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02475","headline":"祭方丘乐章 顺和 · 褚亮","name":"祭方丘乐章 顺和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万物资以化，交泰属昇平。\n易从业惟简，得一道斯宁。\n具仪光玉帛，送舞变咸英。\n黍稷良非贵，明德信惟馨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"褚亮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02475.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02475","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}